<title>FINLAND: Nokia says 1996 earnings due Feb 13.</title>
<headline>Nokia says 1996 earnings due Feb 13.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish telecommunications group Nokia Oy said in a statement on Thursday it will release 1996 financial results on February 13.</p>
<p>Nokia's annual report will be published &quot;in early March&quot; and the annual general meeting will be held on March 25.</p>
<p>Nokia will publish its Q1 (January-March) interim report on April 29, the Q2 report on August 4 and the Q3 report on October 30, it said.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
